  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NCA School rehab in Kos</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NCA Skolrehab i Kosovo 00</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet avser rehabilitera 10 prim&#xE4;rskolor i Vushtri kommun, genom NCA, som fick Sida finansiering att genomf&#xF6;ra basreparationer av skoloi samma omr&#xE5;de. Detta projekt &#xE4;r en forts&#xE4;ttning av det f&#xF6;rsta, men fokuseras p&#xE5; kompletterande reparationer avseende bl a sanitet, trafiks&#xE4;kring av skolomr&#xE5;det med st&#xE4;ngsel, lekplats, mm. Tid: 2001</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supplements a previous Sida finansed project, through NCAin Vushtri municipality. These supplementary works focus on sanitary facilities, traffik safety by putting up fences, playgrounds for the younger students, etc. Project timeframe: 2001</narrative>
  </description>
